             * receipts: the stage-2 module's own LZSS (cur_fn=0x801D2FE8,
             * translated overlay code with NO injected guard) ran away past
             * 35 MILLION suppressed reads - aborts=0 forever, because the
             * R926 "translated-loop abort" fuel only ignites inside the
             * emitted guard of KERNEL fn 0x80032EB4; module-window code
             * never had it injected. The runaway burned 143s of runtime to
             * a fuse SIGKILL (137). The receipts name the context: the
             * module reached its pre-movie loop (park census t=112-142s:
             * 801D3070/801D3190/801D2FE8 + exe-side 8002675C/800269CC),
             * polls for file#7 (seek=108886) that never arrives (A22C=0,
