     * dispatch, f14 gate MATCH, linker pass, door knocked @t=174s), a
     * walk returning to startIntrVSync+0x30 (r31=0x8004BF50) poisoned the
     * walker cells (FAEC/92C0/92BC/92D0/F0C/F10 -> 08080808), SB'd into
     * the stage-2 window (0x801EF59F), SB'd val=8 past RAM from
     * 0x80200000 up, and word-wrote 0x801D2D00 (R763, writer_fn=0x8004C01C
     * = memclrIntrVSync). Decomp contract (psyq/libetc/intr_vsync.c:15,
     * symbol_addrs.slus_006.64.txt:844): startIntrVSync clears EXACTLY
     * 8 slots of g_VsyncInterruptCallbacks = 0x80058940..0x80058960,
     * value NULL. Any store returning to 0x8004BF50 outside that array =
