     * receipt collision ("[crash] host[statestamp]" - two writers
     * interleaved mid-printf). This [wd] line printed on EVERY 2s alarm
     * FROM INSIDE THE SIGALRM HANDLER - fprintf is not async-signal-safe,
     * and ~50 of these per run is the only unbounded in-handler print
