                            /* R1210 (c25 storm-start receipts): the game was
                             * advancing NATIVELY at the state-9->10 boundary
                             * (own cell writes at 31881-31882; response
                             * consumed + acknowledged at 31866-31880) when the
                             * h2 fallback dispatched STARTER 0x8002A68C
                             * (a0=3) with GARBAGE depth ([smtr] bounce
                             * depth=0xFFFFF02A20C51450, a text blob), which
                             * stamped FE1C=10 with a garbage member-9 request
                             * ([stab] LBA=25941 size=24985856 vs the
                             * receipted ftab: files 8-11 LBA=0 size=0) and
                             * opened the SIGBUS storm (fault #1 at
                             * 0x80042090). Post-movie DECLINE the fallback.
                             * The game's OWN handler at 0x564A4 still
                             * dispatches - only the host fallback declines. */
